Horizon Quests — Horizon-native workshop mod (FTB Quests–inspired).

Inspired by FTB Quests for Minecraft Java. Not affiliated with FTB Team.
Clean reimplementation for Horizon — not a jar port. Do not copy FTB assets/code
(typically All Rights Reserved). No SNBT import of TFG quest packs.

Requires Horizon Teams (`mods/teams/`) for party progress.

Plan: docs/quests-plan.md
Tracker: mods/quests/tracker/catalog.json

Art / sounds: workshop-owned procedural textures; `sounds.json` uses vanilla
event refs where needed. FTB Quests ARR assets are **not** copied
(silent-by-design for FTB UI blips).

Original Rust and JSON in this folder: MIT unless noted otherwise.
Minecraft / Mojang assets are not redistributed.
